  "description": "<p><strong>&bull; Brand introduction:</strong></p>\r\n<p data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\" data-immersive-translate-paragraph=\"1\">CITYMONS is a leading brand in the automotive accessories and outdoor sports industry, specializing in innovative products for self-driving RV trailers. Based in the United States, CITYMONS offers a range of high-quality trailer arms and related products designed to enhance your travel experience. Our commitment to innovation and customer satisfaction sets us apart in the market.<br><br></p>\r\n<p data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\"><strong data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\" data-immersive-translate-paragraph=\"1\">&bull; Product description:<span class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" translate=\"no\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-immersive-translate-loading-id=\"1\">&nbsp;<span class=\"immersive-translate-loading-spinner notranslate\"></span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p>Introducing the CITYMONS Endo-hitch, a revolutionary trailer arm designed for seamless travel. Endo-hitch features an innovative design that ensures a quieter ride, easy installation without the need for additional tools, and robust construction capable of handling the toughest journeys.</p>\r\n<p data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\"><strong data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\">\r\n<li data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\" data-immersive-translate-paragraph=\"1\"><strong data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\">Innovative Design:</strong> Our Endo-hitch is engineered to provide a quieter and smoother ride, reducing noise and vibration.</li>\r\n<li data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\" data-immersive-translate-paragraph=\"1\"><strong data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\">Easy Installation:</strong> The Endo-hitch can be installed effortlessly without the need for extra tools, saving you time and hassle.</li>\r\n<li data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\" data-immersive-translate-paragraph=\"1\"><strong data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\">Durability:</strong> Built to last, the Endo-hitch is designed to withstand heavy loads and harsh conditions, ensuring reliable performance on every trip.\r\n<p data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\"><strong data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\" data-immersive-translate-paragraph=\"1\">&bull; Payment terms:</strong></p>\r\n<p data-immersive-translate-walked=\"9e90092f-ac45-4484-a186-abfc873d6a21\" data-immersive-translate-paragraph=\"1\">We payment methods, including major credit cards PayPal, and bank transfers. Payment is required at the time of order placement. For bulk orders or special payment arrangements, please contact our sales team for further assistance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-immersive-translate-walked=\"51582690-df41-44f3-b314-169989038fc4\"><strong data-immersive-translate-walked=\"51582690-df41-44f3-b314-169989038fc4\" data-immersive-translate-paragraph=\"1\">Other information:<span class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\" lang=\"zh-CN\"><span class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-none immersive-translate-target-translation-inline-wrapper-theme-none immersive-translate-target-translation-inline-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><span class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-none-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">&bull; 其他信息：</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Special Offer:</strong> Enjoy a 20% discount on your first purchase of the 2Drop 2'' Ball 7500 lbs Endo-hitch with the code <strong>XPSS20</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Delivery:</strong> Orders are expected to be delivered within 5-7 days after placement.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Customer Support:</strong> Our dedicated customer support team is available to assist you with any inquiries or issues. Feel free to contact us at <a rel=\"noreferrer\">support@citymons.net</a>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Return Policy:</strong> We offer a 7-day return or exchange policy. If the product has any quality issues, we will provide a replacement or return within 7 days.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
